            <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand mt-4 mb-6 leading-tight">
              Sintomas de Olho Seco: Quando Procurar Ajuda
            </h1>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4 text-gray-500 text-sm flex-wrap">
                <span class="font-medium text-brand">Dr. Philipe Saraiva Cruz · CRM-MG 69.870</span>
                <span>•</span>
                <span>10 de Dezembro, 2025</span>
                <span>•</span>
                <span>Leitura de 7 min</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        </div>

